  "description": "Step 10, compute: batch, boil time, mash and fermentation temperature, the OG used (before rounding; moved inside its tolerance towards the ABV target, or not), the colour adjustment (darkest and absorber null when nothing could change; second is the second pass, null when there was none), the mash used, fermentables in kg, hops and extras in g, yeasts in packs, the numbers (srm_lower_bound names fermentables with no colour, counted as 0 EBC), one values_used line for each value picked from a range, rounding (the weighing steps; whether a grist on them avoided every failure the exact amounts did not have, the failures it added, the fermentables not at their nearest step, why), and recipe: the formulation_check.input object step 11 checks (its targets.og is the OG used). Absent: numbers.fg, numbers.abv and numbers.attenuation_pct null when the yeast has no attenuation figure; colour.darkest and colour.absorber null; extras empty.",
